ndled as smoothly as possible we request that you follow the checklist sections below.\r\nChoose the right checklist for the change that you're making:\r\n-->\r\n\r\nFixes #31286\r\n\r\nI was going through the [Auth0 example](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/tree/canary/examples/auth0) and hit the following issue (screencap):\r\n\r\n<img width=\"964\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2021-11-10 at 12 57 41 PM\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/2515575/141226775-08e5e1d3-618c-4fae-a133-70685c7b3ad2.png\">\r\n\r\nThis just updates the call there to pass `res`, which matches the signature documented here: https://auth0.github.io/nextjs-auth0/modules/session_get_session.html\r\n\r\nWith this fix, the rest of the example worked wonderfully 👍.\r\n\r\n## Bug\r\n\r\n- [x] Related issues linked using `fixes #number`\r\n- [ ] Integration tests added (NA?)\r\n- [x] Errors have helpful link attached, see `contributing.md`\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/31284/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/31284/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":5601226855,"node_id":"CE_lADOBC3Cis4-nYx5zwAAAAFN2_Bn","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/events/5601226855","actor":{"login":"kodiakhq[bot]","id":49736102,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk3MzYxMDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/29196?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kodiakhq%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/kodiakhq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kodiakhq%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kodiakhq%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kodiakhq%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kodiakhq%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/r